# SAP integration (course API pool) — copy to .env.local and fill in.
# Never commit real values. The dev-server proxy reads these server-side;
# they are never bundled into frontend code.
# API: API_EHS_REPORT_INCIDENT_SRV (EHS Incident - Create, Read, v1.0.0,
# SAP_COM_0369). Sandbox host per supplied OpenAPI:
# https://sandbox.api.sap.com/s4hanacloud/sap/opu/odata/sap/API_EHS_REPORT_INCIDENT_SRV
# Set SAP_API_BASE_URL to the host origin only (no service path), e.g.
# https://sandbox.api.sap.com/s4hanacloud for the sandbox.
SAP_API_BASE_URL=
SAP_API_KEY=
# Optional: override the OData entity set (default A_Incident, per SAP's
# EHS incident integration guide).
# SAP_API_ENTITY_SET=
